  "description": "Color picker and font picker add-ons built for WPF. Includes color dialog, color picker popup/control, font dialog, font picker popup/control. Dialogs follow Winform layout, controls can be added directly in xaml and support collapsing. The interface automatically displays the corresponding language according to the threads, the localization includes 14 languages.\n为WPF打造的颜色选择器和字体选择器附加功能。包括颜色对话框、颜色选择下拉/控件、字体对话框、字体选择下拉/控件。对话框沿用Winform的布局，控件可以直接在xaml中插入并支持折叠。界面根据线程自动显示对应语言，本地化包括14种语言。",
